Package: alignr
Title: Align Figure Layout for RStudio and Positron
Version: 2026.9.4.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Derrick", "Staten", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "statenderrick@gmail.com"),
    person("Align", role = "cph"))
Description: Opens the Align multi-page figure canvas in the RStudio/Positron
    Viewer pane, rendering R visualizations through the live session — the
    user's installed packages and in-memory data frames, no WASM, no upload.
    See ALI-186. On macOS/arm64 install the compiled dependencies as binaries
    (install.packages(c("svglite","httpuv","jsonlite","openssl","curl"), type = "binary")) —
    source builds need a C++ toolchain plus freetype/harfbuzz.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/derrickstaten/alignr, https://alignfigures.com
BugReports: https://github.com/derrickstaten/alignr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    base64enc,
    curl,
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    svglite
Suggests:
    keyring,
    rstudioapi,
    ggplot2
